# CAP NEW before CAP END is requested too, and CAP END waits for its answer.
= caps away-notify multi-prefix
> CAP LS 302
> NICK textual
> USER textual 0 * Textual
< :irc.example CAP * LS :multi-prefix
> CAP REQ multi-prefix
< :irc.example CAP * NEW :away-notify
> CAP REQ away-notify
< :irc.example CAP * ACK multi-prefix
< :irc.example CAP * ACK away-notify
> CAP END
< :irc.example 001 textual :Welcome
? registered textual
